'dxm-cough-medicine-abuse-teens-family-guide',
'DXM Abuse in Teens: What Parents Need to Know About Cough Medicine Highs',
'DXM abuse in teens is rising and cough medicine is easy to hide. Learn the warning signs, the real risks, and what parents should do next.',
'Substance Guide',
'https://rizfkjgwhcpwiryyqejx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/dxm-abuse-in-teens-cover.jpg',
true,
